Compiling Baseline C Library Header Files and Runtime

1. Download and extract clean Musl C library sources:

`curl -O https://musl.libc.org/releases/musl-1.2.5.tar.gz`
`tar -xf musl-1.2.5.tar.gz && cd musl-1.2.5`

2. Configure and build libc:

`./configure --prefix=/usr`
`make -j$(nproc)`
`make install`
